Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.74,0:00:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mighty Little Defenders 11 – New Wild Cosmos.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.74,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}I’m Still There
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.74,Title1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Episode 58
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.38,0:12:16.94,end,,0,0,0,,To be continued
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.20,0:00:28.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Who…who exactly are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.71,0:00:32.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I am the Savior.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.79,0:00:41.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, the Protective Dome’s energy is draining rapidly.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.47,0:00:42.99,Default,,0,0,0,,At this rate, I’m afraid…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.03,0:00:46.21,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s over; we’re going to be absorbed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.01,0:00:48.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s not time to give up yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.32,0:00:51.48,Default,,0,0,0,,The kids are still fighting hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.72,0:00:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We can’t admit defeat either.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.68,0:01:07.68,Default,,0,0,0,,“Savior”? I’d say you’re more of the Destroyer.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.04,0:01:10.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You’re{\i0} the ones destroying {\i1}my{\i0} new world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.33,0:01:12.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Sparky!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.33,0:01:17.01,Default,,0,0,0,,To save your own world,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.01,0:01:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,do you have to sacrifice someone else’s?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.00,0:01:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to stop you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.40,0:01:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You’re nothing but ants.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.67,0:01:58.31,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s huge.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.78,0:02:01.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.77,0:02:27.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn’t expect your friends to be such a handful.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.07,0:02:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,More than just a handful—we’re going to defeat you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.18,0:02:36.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you laughing at? As long as there’s light in our eyes,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.10,0:02:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,we can definitely do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.19,0:02:44.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Childish. I once saw a fascinating kind of insect in Green Green Grassland.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.18,0:02:47.06,Default,,0,0,0,,They love flying toward the light.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.18,0:02:49.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I think they’re called moths.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.38,0:02:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at your worlds.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.90,0:02:56.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I have nearly absorbed the four of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.69,0:02:58.69,Default,,0,0,0,,As for you mere moths,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.17,0:03:01.01,Default,,0,0,0,,are you soaring toward the light?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.17,0:03:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Or are you rushing into the flames,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.58,0:03:06.49,Default,,0,0,0,,only to be utterly destroyed?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.25,0:03:13.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Paddi…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.05,0:03:28.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.77,0:03:31.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Trying to play the hero?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.89,0:03:36.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Care to guess how long they’ll last?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.01,0:03:38.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it! Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.56,0:03:49.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that angry outburst of yours just an attempt to hide your own powerlessness?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.77,0:03:55.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think you’ve actually changed anything after sacrificing so many companions?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.96,0:03:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What you saw as a desperate, all-or-nothing gamble was actually just utter stupidity.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.40,0:04:01.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.56,0:04:05.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We both want to save our own worlds.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.20,0:04:09.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You and I are destined to stand on opposite sides—light and shadow.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.87,0:04:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,The difference is, I now possess the power of four worlds.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.24,0:04:15.76,Default,,0,0,0,,And what do {\i1}you{\i0} have left?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.55,0:04:20.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t miss a single corner.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.47,0:04:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe there’s some usable energy in this space.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.76,0:04:27.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.96,0:04:30.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Slowy, I’m detecting life energy here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.80,0:04:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Life energy? Could it be…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.96,0:04:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,that there are other survivors?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.30,0:04:37.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like a planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.97,0:04:38.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.65,0:04:40.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Those houses—that’s the Bulala Kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.41,0:04:42.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m detecting life energy here, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.57,0:04:45.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Although it doesn’t look like a planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.96,0:04:48.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ve found something as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.24,0:04:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s my home, the Xilan Tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.96,0:04:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s wonderful. Our homes are still standing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.64,0:04:56.36,Default,,0,0,0,,So, we aren’t the only survivors.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.40,0:04:59.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe they can help us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.41,0:05:07.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Those who are low on energy should rest for a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.69,0:05:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,With me here, there’s nothing to fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.37,0:05:11.21,Default,,0,0,0,,The boundary has stopped shrinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.21,0:05:12.97,Default,,0,0,0,,We should be safe for the time being.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.05,0:05:14.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You’re the one who needs to rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.97,0:05:17.25,Default,,0,0,0,,If you collapse, I won’t have time to look after you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.85,0:05:20.48,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s true. Even though we’re safe for now,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.48,0:05:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,there’s no telling how long it will last.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.00,0:05:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to conserve my energy. Everyone, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.36,0:05:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.40,0:05:31.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t come any closer. This is my turf. What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.65,0:05:35.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t move around; it’ll mess up my performance.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.69,0:05:41.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s give them water and food once we pull them up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.56,0:05:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We’re out of water and food.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.16,0:05:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like we won’t last much longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.44,0:05:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Unless a miracle happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.20,0:05:51.99,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.23,0:05:54.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Could a miracle really be happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.08,0:05:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Can anyone hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.20,0:06:01.43,Default,,0,0,0,,We are survivors from another world.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.43,0:06:03.55,Default,,0,0,0,,We hope to establish contact with you all,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.55,0:06:05.99,Default,,0,0,0,,and work together to save this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.79,0:06:09.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope they can see my image.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.83,0:06:11.14,Default,,0,0,0,,There’s a response coming through.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.46,0:06:19.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Can anyone understand what they’re saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.95,0:06:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my world; I can understand it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.78,0:06:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,They’re saying hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.62,0:06:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,They didn’t expect any of you to still be alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.74,0:06:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,They are deeply saddened by what you’ve been through.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.36,0:06:33.07,Default,,0,0,0,,And they ask if a connection can be established.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.39,0:06:35.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Can’t they just get straight to the point? Honestly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.75,0:06:38.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like the world here is setting up communication equipment.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.59,0:06:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s adjust the frequency and see if we can link up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.63,0:06:46.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.15,0:06:49.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Straight to the point, alright—but how do we save them?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.34,0:06:54.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems they’re in the same situation as us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.40,0:06:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.20,0:06:58.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Conditions in the other two worlds seem much more stable.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.28,0:07:00.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Could it be that they have a way to protect themselves?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.40,0:07:03.24,Default,,0,0,0,,There’s a response from the Xilan Tree side, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.32,0:07:04.31,Default,,0,0,0,,What did they say?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.75,0:07:07.55,Default,,0,0,0,,The elders say that although more than half of the Xilan Tree was absorbed,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.55,0:07:10.95,Default,,0,0,0,,new shoots are still sprouting, and the Xilan Tree is still growing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.35,0:07:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Still growing? How does that work?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.58,0:07:17.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do the Bulala and Xilan Tree worlds possess such vigorous life force
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.19,0:07:20.95,Default,,0,0,0,,while we and the Blue Planet world continue to crumble away bit by bit?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.15,0:07:23.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it because science can’t beat magic?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.74,0:07:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch this—they’ve both put up a huge pillar.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.54,0:07:29.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Quick, let’s do the same. It must be something to do with our blue Protective Dome.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.76,0:07:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Changing the Protective Dome to multicolored right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.60,0:07:35.83,Default,,0,0,0,,How does that actually work?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.95,0:07:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Grass actually grows on you guys? Is this your Spark plant?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.95,0:07:41.55,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Mr. Slowy’s Smart Grass.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.55,0:07:43.99,Default,,0,0,0,,It grows whenever Mr. Slowy is thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.18,0:07:44.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Lan Zhuzhu
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.98,0:07:45.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Lan Zhuzhu
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.82,0:07:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know why the Xilan Tree keeps growing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.98,0:07:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,The Bulala world looks full of vitality.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.54,0:07:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The Xilan Tree world isn’t significantly affected either.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.76,0:07:55.63,Default,,0,0,0,,And it even grows back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.67,0:07:56.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Slowy
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.99,0:07:59.15,Default,,0,0,0,,The matter of the Xilan Tree is rather complex.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.43,0:08:01.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I’d better just show you my memories directly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.36,0:08:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s sprouting.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.55,0:08:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this the world of the Xilan Tree?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.88,0:08:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,,This is…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.04,0:08:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Could this be the core of the Xilan Tree?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.23,0:08:40.43,Default,,0,0,0,,If we can just find the source of its energy,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.99,0:08:44.95,Default,,0,0,0,,perhaps we can discover a way to gain the same power.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.83,0:09:06.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I…I see it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.66,0:09:12.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The Xilan Tree’s power comes from every member of their people.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.34,0:09:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as they unite,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.84,0:09:18.95,Default,,0,0,0,,they can generate the power that allows the Xilan Tree to thrive endlessly.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.35,0:09:21.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe this method can even stop Blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.07,0:09:23.87,Default,,0,0,0,,But…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.03,0:09:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Even the Xilan Tree world, with its vast population,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.38,0:09:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,couldn’t escape the fate of being absorbed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.22,0:09:35.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Let alone the few of us left.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.06,0:09:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,The people of the entire world…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.40,0:09:42.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Slowy, do you remember the machine that brought us back to Goats’ Village?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.19,0:09:50.27,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s the World Teleportation Device.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.27,0:09:51.87,Default,,0,0,0,,We can use that device
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.87,0:09:54.19,Default,,0,0,0,,to find more people from other worlds to help us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.35,0:09:57.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I know how to use it, Mr. Slowy; let me give it a try.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.55,0:09:58.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll go with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.86,0:10:01.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us go, Mr. Slowy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.62,0:10:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You must come back safely.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.78,0:10:14.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We can’t break free at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.02,0:10:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, our prevention shield is failing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.98,0:10:22.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You’ll soon be absorbed by me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.79,0:10:24.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.35,0:10:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Let them go!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.75,0:10:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Still not giving up? You have no powers whatsoever.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.86,0:10:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What right do you have to protect this world?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.02,0:10:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Your failure is inevitable.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.94,0:10:40.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Face reality—you can’t change a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.17,0:10:43.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.41,0:10:46.33,Default,,0,0,0,,That voice…Could it be…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.55,0:10:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry to keep you waiting, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.42,0:10:53.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Your savior…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.54,0:10:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,King Wolffy has arrived!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.74,0:10:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s Wolffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.94,0:10:58.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Great! We’re saved!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.35,0:11:01.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-You’re Wolffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.35,0:11:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.50,0:11:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Release my friends right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.62,0:11:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Or else King Wolffy will have to take action!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.18,0:11:09.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop showing off and hurry up and save us!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.72,0:11:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that all?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.55,0:11:16.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I came prepared.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.63,0:11:19.27,Default,,0,0,0,,These are enhanced gauntlets custom-made for me by Slowy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.27,0:11:20.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Designed specifically to deal with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.36,0:11:24.59,Default,,0,0,0,,What? It actually neutralized my power!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.94,0:11:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s our turn to strike back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.02,0:11:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s join forces and finish him off in one go!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.42,0:11:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Weslie, we’re here!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.23,0:11:56.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.35,0:11:58.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think you can escape?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.39,0:12:07.31,Default,,0,0,0,,The time has come.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.03,0:12:09.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Become a part of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.03,0:12:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,No! Weslie!
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
